==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Team Up|Zangoose|132}} from the {{TCG|Team Up}} expansion; both cards have the Slash attack.
*{{DL|Skill (Shuffle)|Counterattack}} is a {{OBP|skill|Shuffle}} in [[Pokémon Shuffle]]. As an {{TCG|Ability}} in the TCG, it first appeared as a {{TCG|Pokémon Power}} named '''Strikes Back''' on {{TCG ID|Base Set|Machamp|8}} from the {{TCG|Base Set}}.
*{{m|Slash}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Zangoose}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

